# Frontend Environment Variables

## For LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (localhost)
# When running `npm run dev` locally, leave VITE_API_URL empty or set to /api
# The Vite proxy in vite.config.js will forward /api requests to http://localhost:5000
# VITE_API_URL=/api

## For PRODUCTION (Vercel deployment with EC2 backend)
# Set VITE_API_URL=/api in Vercel environment variables
# Vercel rewrites in vercel.json will proxy /api/* to your EC2 backend
# This avoids mixed content issues (Browser only sees HTTPS)
VITE_API_URL=/api

## EC2 Backend (configured in vercel.json rewrites)
# Currently pointing to: http://13.51.199.247:5000/api/*
